OL,3,GNEWSATeens arrested for waving 'gun' at
OL,4,Ayoung boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 15-year-old boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a suspected firearm was
OL,8,Freportedly waved towards four young
OL,9,Fboys, as police continue searching for
OL,10,Fthe weapon.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Welland, near
OL,13,FMalvern, at about 16:30 BST on Sunday
OL,14,Ffollowing a report that two boys on an
OL,15,Fe-scooter were in possession of a gun.
OL,17,FThey were arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fbeing in possession of a firearm or
OL,19,Fimitation firearm with intent to cause
OL,20,Ffear of violence. They have since been
OL,21,Freleased on bail.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
