OL,3,GNEWSATeens arrested for waving 'gun' at
OL,4,Ayoung boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Polly Price, of West Mercia
OL,7,FPolice, said: "We understand an
OL,8,Fincident of this nature may be alarming
OL,9,Ffor the community, but we want to offer
OL,10,Freassurance that we responded quickly."
